# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Image Tool — Frontend Environment Variables
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file:  cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in the values below.
#   3. NEVER commit .env. It is in .gitignore.
#
# IMPORTANT: All VITE_* variables are BUNDLED INTO THE PUBLIC JS BUILD.
#   ✅ Safe to put here:  Google Client ID, Razorpay Key ID, API base URL
#   ❌ NEVER put here:   JWT secret, DB password, Razorpay Key SECRET
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Backend API URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev:   http://localhost:5000/api
# Production:  https://your-backend.vercel.app/api
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ── Razorpay ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KEY ID only — the secret stays on the backend and is NEVER put here
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
